                '2. $q = (7 - 10.003)/10 \\\\approx -0.300$ → Yallop category F.',
                '3. $V = 7 - (10.003 - 4.672) \\\\approx 1.67$ → Odeh category C (visible only with an optical instrument).',
                'Conclusion and Interpretation',
